  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A participant in a bicycle race completes the race with an average speed of <math alttext=\"24,816\"><mn>24,816</mn>\n</math> yards per hour. What is this average speed, in <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">miles</span> per hour?&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 mile  equals 1,760 yards right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>mile</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1,760</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>yards</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
